# Contains real passenger PII (names, PNRs, ticket data) — data lives safely
# in Supabase already, no need to duplicate it in version control.
supabase/seed_data/*.csv
# Rollback snapshots and one-off audit output from the migration scripts in
# scripts/. Every one holds production row ids and some hold passenger data.
# This is a PATTERN and not a list on purpose: the list it replaces had to be
# extended by hand for each migration, and the first time that was forgotten a
# snapshot of 1,944 live ticket ids was left sitting staged for commit.
*snapshot*.json
deleted-rows-*.json
vendor-merge-*.json
iata-phase4-report.json
iata-commission-audit.json
iata-commission-balance-preview.json

# Backup output and its log. Real passenger data — must never be committed,
# and the default location is outside the repo for exactly that reason.
backup.log
Aviation Backups/
backups/
*.json.gz
